WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.036 --> 00:00:06.539
- [Singing:] No games, every word that I say is
coming straight from my heart.

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:10.110
My team trash, my team trash, my team trash.

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:12.812
I wanna go slow, then high,
then come back down.

00:00:12.979 --> 00:00:16.883
[Singing:] Ah la, la la laaa.

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:17.951
Almost like a rollercoaster.

00:00:19.486 --> 00:00:23.556
Lou Young. I took an "L" this week.
And part of that punishment

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:28.094
is I gotta write a song and sing it in public.

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:32.132
Almost showtime.
[Singing:] Hoo yeah!

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:35.969
[Slow R&amp;B music]
This is called, “My Fantasy Team is Trash,”

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.973
inspired by “Leave the Door Open.”

